    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Construct a robust outer shell using corrugated fiberboard crating for larger or heavier items. This sturdy framework offers structural stability and allows for secure stacking within the vehicle. For bulkier furniture, these crates act as a secondary containment unit, keeping internal components together and providing a flat, uniform surface that optimizes space utilization in the truck, a key factor in determining the overall .</p>
