      <span style="background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">STATUTORY CLEARANCE</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for Packers And Movers Hazaribagh To Haldia</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you plan a move from Hazaribagh to Haldia, the first step is to understand the statutory paperwork and risk coverage that reputable packers and movers hazaribagh must handle. These documents not only keep the shift compliant with Indian law but also protect your belongings against loss, damage, or unexpected delays.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e‑Way Bill</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Under the Goods and Services Tax regime, any consignment of household goods valued over ₹50,000 requires an e‑Way bill. The bill is generated online, includes the GSTIN of the mover, the consignee’s details, and the exact weight and value of the cargo.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>This satisfies the gst on shifting of household goods requirement and enables smooth interstate transport without checkpoints</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR) / Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Indian Builders Association (IBA) standardises the LR/Bilty, which acts as the legal contract between you and the mover. It records the date, vehicle number, origin, destination, and a detailed inventory. An authentic LR is crucial for claim settlement and serves as proof of delivery for domestic household packers and movers service providers.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Declaration of Value</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The mover must obtain a written declaration of the total declared value of your goods. This figure is the basis for insurance premium calculation and for any compensation claim.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Beyond paperwork, risk coverage is anchored by a comprehensive marine transit insurance approved by the IRDAI. The policy offers 100 % declared‑value coverage, meaning you are reimbursed for the full market price of items lost or damaged due to accidental collision, fire, theft, or natural calamities.</p>
<p>It also includes a clause for unforeseen delays, providing compensation for per‑day storage costs if the cargo is held up beyond the agreed transit time.</p>

<ul>
<li>Accidental collision or overturning of the vehicle.</li>
<li>Fire, flood, or other natural disasters during transit.</li>
<li>Theft or pilferage at any point of the journey.</li>
<li>Delay indemnity for extended detention beyond the scheduled delivery.</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Choosing a reliable packers and movers in hazaribagh means checking household moving company reviews, confirming they issue IBA‑approved LR/Bilty, and verifying that they bundle the IRDAI marine insurance with the service.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Whether you are doing campus to home shifting or relocating between cities, the charges for shifting home between indian cities typically include packing material, labor, transport, e‑Way bill processing, and insurance premium.</span></li></ul>
<p>Transparent providers will itemise each cost, helping you compare offers from different movers and packers hazaribagh firms and select the best value for a hassle‑free relocation.</p></div>
